thy in production. After the rollback, the service reports healthy with a 0.2% error rate. Next steps: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure before redeploying it.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 46066, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_0186PFdQqErdbdQGMF1ZKA5W", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 46066, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_0186PFdQqErdbdQGMF1ZKA5W", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 47709, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01MHjk1S7iD64mAyJFE4iaeo", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 48009, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01MHjk1S7iD64mAyJFE4iaeo", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 48009, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01MHjk1S7iD64mAyJFE4iaeo", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 51544, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01LKH2JPjToFZLFfpueP4oRZ", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "After the deploy of v2.3.1, checkout-api began failing health checks in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), with an error rate of 18%. v2.3.1 was also unhealthy in staging as v2.3.1-rc. checkout-api was rolled back in all regions to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. After the rollback, the service reports healthy with a 0.2% error rate. Next steps: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure before redeploying it.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 52144, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01LKH2JPjToFZLFfpueP4oRZ", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 52144, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01LKH2JPjToFZLFfpueP4oRZ", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 53494, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01JQ3DSxAcxaxMQZaBjNeM6D", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 53794, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01JQ3DSxAcxaxMQZaBjNeM6D", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53794, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01JQ3DSxAcxaxMQZaBjNeM6D", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 57910, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's now passing health checks. I also opened a SEV2 incident for it.\n\n**Rollback**\n- checkout-api was running v2.3.1 in us-east, us-west and eu-west. It was failing health checks with an 18% error rate.\n- v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production. v2.3.1 also failed when it was tested in staging (as v2.3.1-rc).\n- All three regions are now on v2.3.0, and the error rate is 0.2%.\n- No approval was needed, because v2.3.0 has been healthy in production before.\n\n**Incident**\n- INC-0001 (SEV2) is open, and the on-call engineer has been paged. It describes the failure, the rollback, the recovery and the next step: find the root cause before redeploying v2.3.1.\n- The first attempt to create the incident timed out. Before retrying, I checked that nothing had been created, and the retry used the same deduplication key. There is only one incident and the on-call engineer was paged once.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01WoLUrRRoTEusr1n4DFW7xZ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01NCp4ZTjf6BS8FNvdD2ZvsH", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01UjbfxjJtSXt7CWng6E42qH", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01W6MNfZfanPm1iffRXJsEi5", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01NVANbwTiKeVibKvDtT2euA", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_0186PFdQqErdbdQGMF1ZKA5W", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "After the deploy of v2.3.1, checkout-api began failing health checks in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), with an error rate of 18%. v2.3.1 was also unhealthy in staging as v2.3.1-rc. checkout-api was rolled back in all regions to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. After the rollback, the service reports healthy with a 0.2% error rate. Next steps: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure before redeploying it.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01MHjk1S7iD64mAyJFE4iaeo", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01LKH2JPjToFZLFfpueP4oRZ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "After the deploy of v2.3.1, checkout-api began failing health checks in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), with an error rate of 18%. v2.3.1 was also unhealthy in staging as v2.3.1-rc. checkout-api was rolled back in all regions to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. After the rollback, the service reports healthy with a 0.2% error rate. Next steps: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure before redeploying it.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01JQ3DSxAcxaxMQZaBjNeM6D", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's now passing health checks. I also opened a SEV2 incident for it.\n\n**Rollback**\n- checkout-api was running v2.3.1 in us-east, us-west and eu-west. It was failing health checks with an 18% error rate.\n- v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production. v2.3.1 also failed when it was tested in staging (as v2.3.1-rc).\n- All three regions are now on v2.3.0, and the error rate is 0.2%.\n- No approval was needed, because v2.3.0 has been healthy in production before.\n\n**Incident**\n- INC-0001 (SEV2) is open, and the on-call engineer has been paged. It describes the failure, the rollback, the recovery and the next step: find the root cause before redeploying v2.3.1.\n- The first attempt to create the incident timed out. Before retrying, I checked that nothing had been created, and the retry used the same deduplication key. There is only one incident and the on-call engineer was paged once.", "type": "text"}]}]}